          "prompt": "Use case: stylized-concept.\nAsset type: exact four-view concept sheet to reconstruct ONE OPEN walk-through monumental gateway using local Hunyuan3D.\nPrimary request: monumental architecture for a first-person roguelite scene with the bold readable hand-painted visual quality of Gunfire Reborn, moderate detail, clear shape and broad matte color blocks.\nComposition/framing: ONE horizontal sheet on uniform pure white background, FOUR equal-width isolated panels, orthographic FRONT / LEFT / BACK / RIGHT in that order. Repeat the EXACT same structure at identical physical scale and ground baseline. Full silhouette with large margins. No perspective, labels, text, scene or contact shadow.\nSubject geometry, crucial: ONE complete inverted U-shaped freestanding gate, 10.5m total width, 6.8m total height, 1.7m depth. Two broad solid upright posts at the left and right ends support one chunky horizontal lintel. The ground-level passage is EMPTY WHITE BACKGROUND: at least 6.6m clear width and 4m clear height, full uninterrupted opening from the ground to the lintel. Front and back both reveal the same completely open passage. There is absolutely NO door, no wall, no niche backing, no fill, no panel, no floor/sill connecting the bottom of the posts. The two posts connect ONLY across their top by the lintel. Posts have broad stable bases and fused broad capitals. The lintel is thick enough to reconstruct and has a simple stepped cap with at most one subtle central architectural crest. Every ornament is broad and fused to the structure; no hanging ropes, chains, tiny detached pieces. Narrow LEFT/RIGHT side views show the real 1.7m structural depth and same material construction.\nStyle/medium: stylized hand-painted 3D concept, simple broad faceted planes, robust proportions, simplified East-Asian fantasy architecture. Medium-scale structural ornaments only, smooth painted color gradients, restrained wear. Even neutral studio lighting, gentle shading, no glossy highlights or baked cast shadows.\nAvoid: filled/closed passage, door leaf, solid backdrop, photorealism, micrograin, tiny cracks, ornate miniature carvings, delicate rafters, separate props, text, logo, watermark.\nChapter palette and construction: ancient East-Asian volcanic fortress, deep aubergine and charcoal-blue basalt masonry, rust-red painted recesses, dull warm bronze broad trim and one or two flat orange inlaid accents. Angular slab construction, dark sturdy structural silhouette, no neon lava rivers, no emissive lighting, no chains or spikes.\nOpening proportion check: in FRONT and BACK, the narrowest clear gap BETWEEN the bottom bases is 65 percent of total gate width, the same central gap remains fully open up to 60 percent of total gate height. Make posts slim enough, with each bottom base no wider than 17 percent of overall width. The empty passage is the dominant shape.",
